    "reductions": "Minimal equivalent of issue #1529: an undeclared bootstrap source and ConfigMap hello. GitRepository, OCIRepository, and Bucket use the same Kustomization. The sync-oci cases reduce xunholy/k8s-gitops@2f2e6edc730457a3f45d7a73aad536afc683b5eb: the chart sync values become a FluxInstance inside an unavailable ResourceSet, and four consumers keep artifact-relative paths absent from the repository root. The sync-oci-direct cases declare the same FluxInstance directly and retain the unavailable source through the complete CLI lifecycle."
